<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Dec 28--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Dec 28--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---12/28/96  12/21/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		   -29.8	17,308    24,670    20,662</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products -13.1	 8,828    10,163     8,519</p>
<p> Other Farm Products -44.9	 1,413     2,565     1,344</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	 -26.7	12,983    17,706    18,994</p>
